                    "id": "735030701",
                    "speaker": "Board with riddles",
                    "text": "\"Above the stream running, under the trees green.\""
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7350301",
            "objective": "",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "735030101",
                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                    "text": "Oh, this is a good one..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "735030102",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Are you working on your riddles again?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "735030103",
                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                    "text": "Traveler! You've come at the right time! I'm about to design a whole new series of riddles."
                },
                {
                    "id": "735030104",
                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                    "text": "The terrain here is a little complicated. See, there is a huge root of the Divine Tree entering the water from one side of the harbor."
                },
                {
                    "id": "735030105",
                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                    "text": "On the other side is a huge lotus leaf, and a lot of ships waiting to leave the harbor."
                },
                {
                    "id": "735030106",
                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                    "text": "Traveler, which side do you feel is better as the theme for this riddle?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "735030107",
                            "text": "It's better to start with the root system.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "735030108",
                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                    "text": "Really? The huge root system of the Divine Tree is quite conspicuous, and easily seen as the \"entry point\" of the riddle."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735030109",
                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                    "text": "Okay! I'll write a riddle with the root system as the theme.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "735030115",
                                            "text": "Hehe, let me write something."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "735030116",
                                            "text": "Hehe, leave it to me.",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030117",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Hey! Why are you grinning like that!?"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030118",
                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                    "text": "Done. Here, have a look."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030119",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "\"Where knowledge returns to the sea, treasure lies along the sails.\""
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030120",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "It reads well! And this riddle also makes people think of \"port\" really easily..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030121",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "And when it's put with \"where knowledge returns to the sea,\" it's easy to see that the location is related to the Akademiya or Sumeru City..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030122",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "I never knew you had such a talent."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030123",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "Wait a minute, I'll paste this riddle in a place where it can be easily discovered..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030124",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Huh? Paste it in this area? But the location in the riddle is not that far away. It might be solved right away."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030125",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "Hahaha, I'm giving the riddle solver a range to solve the riddles in."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030126",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "If I don't do this, then the range will be too big."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030127",
                                                    "speaker": "Black Screen",
                                                    "text": "Drusus starts putting up the riddle..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030128",
                                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                                    "text": "Okay, the riddle for this area is done. Let's go to the next place."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "735030129",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Eh? There's another place...?"
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "735030110",
                            "text": "The lotus leaf and ships are interesting.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "735030111",
                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                    "text": "Indeed... It could be fun in another sense if we link the two."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "735030112",
                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                    "text": "No problem, I'll just make a riddle with this theme.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "735030115",
                                            "text": "Hehe, let me write something."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "735030116",
                                            "text": "Hehe, leave it to me."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "735030113",
                            "text": "These are too easy!",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "735030114",
                                    "speaker": "Drusus",
                                    "text": "Too easy? What ideas do you have then?",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "735030115",
                                            "text": "Hehe, let me write something."
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "735030116",
                                            "text": "Hehe, leave it to me."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
